   - (B) → Ozonolysis → (C) and (D):  
     - (C): \( \text{CH}_3\text{COCH}_3 \) (Acetone, gives Fehling test)  
     - (D): \( \text{CH}_3\text{CH}_2\text{CHO} \) (Propanal, does not give Fehling test)  

Final Answer:  
- (A): \( \boxed{\text{CH}_3\text{CH}=\text{C}(\text{CH}_3)\text{OH}} \) (2-Methylbut-2-en-1-ol)  
