"An article costs a certain amount. It must be marked at a price so that after deducting 10% from the list price, it may be sold at a profit of 25% on the cost price. The price must be Rs. 65.97. What is the cost price of the article?","<bos><start_of_turn>user
An article costs a certain amount. It must be marked at a price so that after deducting 10% from the list price, it may be sold at a profit of 25% on the cost price. The price must be Rs. 65.97. What is the cost price of the article?<end_of_turn>
