\]  
Using Newton's second law, \( F = mv \), we can find the acceleration \( a \):  
\[
a = \frac{F}{m} = \frac{8.00 \times 10^{-17} \, \text{N}}{1.67 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{kg}} \approx 4.81 \, \text{m/s}^2
\]  
Thus, the magnitude of the acceleration of the proton is \(\boxed{4.81 \, \text{m/s}^2}\).  

