m is the mass of the body
a_t is the tangential acceleration
r is the radius of the bobole

In this case, we have:
m = 1 kg
a_t = 2 m/s^2
r = 0.5 m

Plugging these values into the formula, we get:

F = (1 kg) * (2 m/s^2) / (0.5 m)
